WEBVTT

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:23.050
Before I knew it, I abandoned happiness to survive

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:30.190
Lying to myself, I danced clinging on to illusions

00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:36.870
At the edge of my vision when I close my eyes

00:00:37.260 --> 00:00:42.830
I was searching for your smile

00:00:43.730 --> 00:00:50.200
With our memories fading

00:00:50.740 --> 00:00:57.280
We hold on to our dreams and run  Yeah

00:00:57.610 --> 00:01:04.180
These feelings that I shut away in my heart

00:01:04.720 --> 00:01:11.410
I'll now grasp them again

00:01:30.850 --> 00:01:32.940
All right!  Yugi won!

00:01:32.940 --> 00:01:35.060
He won the Battle City Tournament!

00:01:35.060 --> 00:01:38.940
Marik's dark side is gone, and Mai and Bakura are back to normal.

00:01:38.940 --> 00:01:42.850
Yugi has all the God Cards.  What a happy ending!

00:01:42.850 --> 00:01:44.350
Huh?  What?

00:01:44.350 --> 00:01:45.820
Blow up the island?

00:01:45.820 --> 00:01:48.770
Kaiba!  Don't be a sore loser!

00:01:48.770 --> 00:01:51.970
The Battle Ship's engines aren't working, so we can't leave!

00:01:51.970 --> 00:01:54.420
What'll happen to us?

00:01:54.990 --> 00:02:01.000
Alcatraz in Flames

00:02:01.420 --> 00:02:02.370
Kaiba!

00:02:02.580 --> 00:02:04.350
Mr. Seto!

00:02:04.350 --> 00:02:05.840
Mokuba!

00:02:05.840 --> 00:02:09.580
C'mon, you two!  Stop sulking and come on out!

00:02:09.580 --> 00:02:12.000
Stop joking around!

00:02:12.420 --> 00:02:16.380
They may be planning to stay on this island and die!

00:02:16.580 --> 00:02:17.880
Sorry.

00:02:17.880 --> 00:02:22.150
But we're also in danger if the Battle Ship's engines aren't fixed.

00:02:22.150 --> 00:02:27.940
Yeah.  We have to find Kaiba so that he'll stop the timer.

00:02:28.320 --> 00:02:29.860
Let's search.

00:02:29.860 --> 00:02:31.660
This isn't a big island.

00:02:31.660 --> 00:02:33.170
We'll find them.

00:02:33.170 --> 00:02:34.220
You're right.

00:02:47.900 --> 00:02:52.710
Yugi, I dueled you on top of this tower and lost.

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:03.860
Kaiba!  Hate cannot lead to true victory!

00:03:03.860 --> 00:03:06.900
Use this defeat to overcome your hate.

00:03:16.600 --> 00:03:18.900
The card I received from a friend...

00:03:18.900 --> 00:03:22.450
My friend's power brought me victory!

00:03:23.520 --> 00:03:25.240
A friend's power...

00:03:27.240 --> 00:03:30.310
Big brother, I entered the password.

00:03:46.750 --> 00:03:47.810
No good?

00:03:48.040 --> 00:03:49.310
Damn!

00:03:52.310 --> 00:03:57.450
Battle City was not only my fight to become the Duel King...

00:03:57.450 --> 00:04:02.060
...but also a fight against my hate towards Gozaburo.

00:04:03.020 --> 00:04:05.950
My hatred may have summoned him.

00:04:05.950 --> 00:04:10.100
He came back from the dead to confront me.

00:04:12.600 --> 00:04:14.700
Welcome, Seto.

00:04:15.780 --> 00:04:19.640
I wanted to have a nice, long talk with you.

00:04:20.540 --> 00:04:21.840
Don't make me laugh.

00:04:22.140 --> 00:04:23.980
Don't be like that.

00:04:23.980 --> 00:04:26.010
We have plenty of time.

00:04:26.220 --> 00:04:31.780
Even if I had a million hours, there's only one thing I want to say to you.

00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:35.020
Send us back to the real world!

00:04:39.390 --> 00:04:43.490
Why don't we decide it in a game?

00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:50.070
Just like when you asked me to adopt you.

00:04:55.340 --> 00:04:58.580
Seto!

00:05:01.110 --> 00:05:05.450
Gozaburo!  I won't lose to you!

00:05:24.100 --> 00:05:26.870
But he was just a crazy ghost.

00:05:27.220 --> 00:05:30.270
I thoroughly pummeled him.

00:05:30.680 --> 00:05:37.080
And the symbol of Kaiba Corporation's military business will now sink into the ocean.

00:05:38.180 --> 00:05:39.280
But...

00:05:40.740 --> 00:05:44.290
Have I really defeated him?

00:05:45.890 --> 00:05:48.680
What's wrong?  Hurry up.

00:05:50.210 --> 00:05:53.360
The road I should take...

00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:06.110
A long time ago, I shared my dream with Mokuba.

00:06:06.680 --> 00:06:08.220
Finished, Mokuba!

00:06:08.220 --> 00:06:10.280
A sand amusement park!

00:06:10.280 --> 00:06:12.620
Wow!  It's amazing, big brother!

00:06:12.920 --> 00:06:14.620
You're always amazing!

00:06:15.750 --> 00:06:17.620
This is nothing.

00:06:18.440 --> 00:06:19.840
Listen, Mokuba.

00:06:19.840 --> 00:06:23.860
My dream is to build amusement parks all over the world.

00:06:24.240 --> 00:06:28.100
Not out of sand, but real ones.

00:06:28.420 --> 00:06:33.400
And orphans like the kids here can play for free!

00:06:33.400 --> 00:06:35.200
So everyone can play!

00:06:35.420 --> 00:06:36.210
Yeah!

00:06:41.680 --> 00:06:47.620
Just like Alcatraz, my soul may have been buried under debris.

00:06:47.620 --> 00:06:49.400
Brother, hurry!

00:06:55.360 --> 00:06:59.000
My road lies under the debris!

00:07:10.870 --> 00:07:13.880
Only 13 minutes left!

00:07:13.880 --> 00:07:16.340
What?  13 minutes?

00:07:16.340 --> 00:07:17.250
Hey!

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:19.820
What's wrong with you?

00:07:19.820 --> 00:07:21.940
Go stop the timer!

00:07:21.940 --> 00:07:24.250
The Battle Ship can't fly yet!

00:07:24.460 --> 00:07:29.490
Only Mr. Seto and Mr. Mokuba know how to stop the timer.

00:07:29.700 --> 00:07:31.590
Damn!  Kaiba!

00:07:33.470 --> 00:07:38.370
Do you really think Kaiba will drown in the ocean with this island?

00:07:38.370 --> 00:07:39.840
There's no way.

00:07:40.550 --> 00:07:42.070
My other self...

00:07:42.070 --> 00:07:47.360
Kaiba always looks ahead to the future.

00:07:47.360 --> 00:07:52.310
I bet he has his own way of leaving the island.

00:07:52.780 --> 00:07:54.320
I hope so.

00:07:54.770 --> 00:07:56.280
There's no time.

00:07:56.280 --> 00:07:58.000
Let's return to the Battle Ship.

00:07:58.000 --> 00:08:03.020
You're right.  Maybe they already returned.

00:08:03.020 --> 00:08:05.940
And the engines may be fixed, too.

00:08:05.940 --> 00:08:06.730
Yeah.

00:08:12.480 --> 00:08:14.470
Otogi!  Are the engines working?

00:08:14.470 --> 00:08:17.570
No!  Not yet!

00:08:17.780 --> 00:08:19.120
What?

00:08:19.460 --> 00:08:21.180
Only 10 minutes left.

00:08:21.180 --> 00:08:23.550
Damn!  What's taking so long?

00:08:23.550 --> 00:08:26.050
You can't fix the engines!

00:08:26.420 --> 00:08:28.860
Be quiet!  Maybe it needs a kick!

00:08:34.620 --> 00:08:37.060
That helicopter came for Jonouchi.

00:08:37.060 --> 00:08:39.530
It's still here!  How lucky!

00:08:42.820 --> 00:08:45.160
Abandon ship!  Hurry!

00:08:45.160 --> 00:08:47.440
The island will soon explode!

00:08:51.860 --> 00:08:57.010
I never thought the helicopter that would take you to the hospital would come in handy.

00:08:57.010 --> 00:08:58.670
Less than a minute!

00:09:00.200 --> 00:09:01.740
We have no choice.

00:09:01.950 --> 00:09:03.020
Take off!

00:09:06.740 --> 00:09:08.260
Thirty seconds.

00:09:14.310 --> 00:09:15.260
Kaiba...

00:09:16.080 --> 00:09:17.100
Mokuba...

00:09:17.360 --> 00:09:18.600
Ten seconds!

00:09:21.050 --> 00:09:22.600
It's going to explode!

00:09:28.210 --> 00:09:30.010
Kaiba!  Mokuba!

00:09:33.460 --> 00:09:34.980
The Duel Tower!

00:09:41.620 --> 00:09:43.860
The Battle Ship...

00:09:46.510 --> 00:09:48.960
The island is sinking.

00:09:56.120 --> 00:09:57.470
That's...!

00:10:01.880 --> 00:10:03.710
Blue-Eyes White Dragon!

00:10:08.910 --> 00:10:10.720
What?

00:10:11.530 --> 00:10:13.220
Well?  Amazed?

00:10:13.600 --> 00:10:15.550
I-It is amazing.

00:10:15.550 --> 00:10:17.080
Unbelievable.

00:10:17.080 --> 00:10:19.960
He's a real idiot.

00:10:19.960 --> 00:10:22.230
Well, I'm glad they're OK.

00:10:22.230 --> 00:10:25.810
Big brother, they're on a helicopter.

00:10:26.540 --> 00:10:29.340
Because the Battle Ship hates them.

00:10:29.340 --> 00:10:30.840
Kaiba!

00:10:31.580 --> 00:10:34.770
We almost died because of you!

00:10:34.770 --> 00:10:36.720
And you dare mock us?

00:10:37.620 --> 00:10:43.640
My brother is going to America for his World Kaiba Land Project.

00:10:43.640 --> 00:10:46.550
World Kaiba Land Project?

00:10:46.840 --> 00:10:49.290
I'll invite you eventually.

00:10:49.660 --> 00:10:50.530
Kaiba...

00:10:52.530 --> 00:10:56.030
Kaiba, that's your new road.

00:11:00.770 --> 00:11:04.040
Yugi, our battle will never end.

00:11:04.260 --> 00:11:05.270
Kaiba!

00:11:10.010 --> 00:11:11.120
Let's go, Mokuba!

00:11:11.120 --> 00:11:14.070
On our way to America!

00:11:27.740 --> 00:11:31.270
Kaiba left to achieve his new dream!

00:11:31.270 --> 00:11:31.940
Yeah.

00:11:31.940 --> 00:11:36.270
And my other self will begin his journey to find his memories.

00:11:36.600 --> 00:11:39.870
All right!  Let's return to Domino City!

00:11:42.900 --> 00:11:45.380
Kaiba Lands all over the world...

00:11:46.110 --> 00:11:47.880
I can't wait, big brother!

00:11:49.540 --> 00:11:51.890
I wish he could see it...

00:12:37.680 --> 00:12:44.820
Thanks to you, Marik is finally free of the darkness in his heart.

00:12:45.160 --> 00:12:46.710
Thank you, Pharaoh.

00:12:48.710 --> 00:12:54.450
The three of us will start a new life as the Ishtar family.

00:12:54.740 --> 00:12:57.820
Pharaoh.  And Yugi the vessel.

00:12:58.060 --> 00:13:01.530
You'll visit Egypt someday.

00:13:01.530 --> 00:13:04.830
When you do, let's travel together as friends.

00:13:05.040 --> 00:13:06.060
Sure.

00:13:06.940 --> 00:13:11.070
Egypt...  To where the other Yugi must return...

00:13:11.320 --> 00:13:15.570
We may not be together for much longer.

00:13:15.820 --> 00:13:19.570
Everyone, I hope our paths cross again.

00:13:22.680 --> 00:13:23.860
Goodbye.

00:13:23.860 --> 00:13:25.300
See you, Marik.

00:13:25.300 --> 00:13:26.080
Take care!

00:13:38.880 --> 00:13:42.930
Well, I'm going back to America too.

00:13:42.930 --> 00:13:43.940
Otogi!

00:13:43.940 --> 00:13:50.080
After hearing about the World Kaiba Land Project, I can't sit around and do nothing.

00:13:50.080 --> 00:13:53.440
I have to think of a new plan for DDM.

00:13:54.100 --> 00:13:56.000
Bye, Shizuka.

00:13:56.000 --> 00:13:57.220
Bye.

00:14:02.280 --> 00:14:04.280
His cell phone number!

00:14:04.280 --> 00:14:06.750
How dare you, Otogi!

00:14:07.480 --> 00:14:08.690
See you again!

00:14:12.130 --> 00:14:13.190
Good luck!

00:14:15.280 --> 00:14:17.200
Everyone left.

00:14:18.730 --> 00:14:22.100
Yeah.  They all have their own goals.

00:14:22.100 --> 00:14:24.200
Traveling their own paths.

00:14:24.560 --> 00:14:28.460
I wonder what my path is...

00:14:28.460 --> 00:14:32.210
Don't worry.  You'll find it eventually.

00:14:32.420 --> 00:14:35.460
You're right, Shizuka!

00:14:38.300 --> 00:14:39.700
Honda!

00:14:41.800 --> 00:14:43.360
Well, I'm leaving too.

00:14:43.940 --> 00:14:45.120
Mai.

00:14:45.120 --> 00:14:47.360
You're leaving too?

00:14:48.280 --> 00:14:51.930
I've always been a wanderer.

00:14:52.380 --> 00:14:58.370
Battle City is over, so I have no reason to stay in this city.

00:14:58.600 --> 00:15:04.380
Mai, you always lifted my spirits.

00:15:07.240 --> 00:15:09.300
He'll be fine.

00:15:09.300 --> 00:15:11.250
He's a good guy.

00:15:11.620 --> 00:15:14.190
He's nice and courageous.

00:15:14.640 --> 00:15:19.860
Even during Duelist Kingdom, he risked his life for you.

00:15:20.420 --> 00:15:26.350
When you remove your bandages, I'm sure he'll live up to your expectations.

00:15:26.350 --> 00:15:27.530
Mai!

00:15:28.540 --> 00:15:30.540
I might be overpraising him.

00:15:31.180 --> 00:15:33.910
Thank you very much.

00:15:35.800 --> 00:15:38.220
I'm the one who should thank you.

00:15:39.140 --> 00:15:44.250
You looked after me when I was unconscious.

00:15:44.250 --> 00:15:45.580
Thank you.

00:15:45.970 --> 00:15:46.920
Yugi!

00:15:48.490 --> 00:15:51.260
Next time we meet, I won't lose!

00:15:51.520 --> 00:15:52.520
Right.

00:16:02.450 --> 00:16:03.480
Bye.

00:16:04.000 --> 00:16:06.980
Take care!  Bye bye!

00:16:07.900 --> 00:16:08.900
Mai...

00:16:09.140 --> 00:16:11.240
What's wrong with you?

00:16:11.570 --> 00:16:13.920
Get it together!

00:16:18.240 --> 00:16:19.140
Mai!

00:16:22.200 --> 00:16:23.760
Umm...  Well...

00:16:24.130 --> 00:16:30.050
When I was with all of you, I had so much fun that I lost track of time.

00:16:30.280 --> 00:16:31.260
But...

00:16:31.930 --> 00:16:36.500
Your friendship is too bright for me.

00:16:39.660 --> 00:16:40.740
Good luck.

00:16:41.080 --> 00:16:42.740
You too.

00:16:49.940 --> 00:16:51.980
Until next time.

00:16:52.620 --> 00:16:53.700
Later.

00:17:04.540 --> 00:17:07.490
Jonouchi, you've grown.

00:17:07.720 --> 00:17:10.180
You're already a true duelist.

00:17:10.800 --> 00:17:13.240
You may be ahead of me now.

00:17:17.740 --> 00:17:20.710
But I'm not done yet!

00:17:24.260 --> 00:17:29.780
Everyone has started traveling their own roads, so I'll travel mine too.

00:17:40.000 --> 00:17:41.900
Good.  It's ready!

00:17:55.840 --> 00:17:58.860
It's early.  Where are you going?

00:17:59.530 --> 00:18:01.650
Well, you know...

00:18:05.420 --> 00:18:08.160
Okay.  Be careful.

00:18:30.380 --> 00:18:33.390
This is your chance for payback.

00:18:33.390 --> 00:18:35.350
Punch them!

00:18:35.520 --> 00:18:39.020
Stop it!  I won't hit my friends!

00:18:41.470 --> 00:18:43.600
This is how.

00:18:43.610 --> 00:18:44.330
What?

00:18:45.100 --> 00:18:46.520
Damn it!

00:18:46.520 --> 00:18:47.520
Jonouchi!

00:18:48.750 --> 00:18:51.100
Yugi, I promise to retrieve them.

00:18:54.140 --> 00:18:57.980
I can't leave the Puzzle behind.

00:18:59.500 --> 00:19:02.280
Fulcrum, leverage and load point!

00:19:11.710 --> 00:19:14.630
Jonouchi, this is your card.

00:19:16.860 --> 00:19:21.570
Yugi, I can't take that Red-Eyes right now.

00:19:24.820 --> 00:19:28.600
I want to become a true duelist.

00:19:28.880 --> 00:19:32.800
No, not "want."  I "will" become a true duelist during Battle City.

00:19:33.060 --> 00:19:42.300
Yugi, when I keep winning and become a true duelist, I want you to duel me again.

00:19:43.800 --> 00:19:45.060
Okay.

00:19:45.060 --> 00:19:47.760
Let's duel when that time comes, Jonouchi.

00:19:50.660 --> 00:19:59.170
Jonouchi, you're a dear friend who taught me that I wasn't alone and gave me courage.

00:19:59.820 --> 00:20:01.270
Yugi...

00:20:03.460 --> 00:20:04.860
Jonouchi...

00:20:05.560 --> 00:20:07.020
I love you.

00:20:10.750 --> 00:20:12.750
This must be a joke.

00:20:12.980 --> 00:20:19.120
If I lose, I'll never reach Mai or Yugi!

00:20:28.170 --> 00:20:29.400
What?

00:20:29.820 --> 00:20:32.380
Yugi.  I...

00:20:33.910 --> 00:20:35.820
Gearfried...

00:20:41.260 --> 00:20:42.910
I win.

00:20:55.700 --> 00:21:01.540
But what can come after that?

00:21:02.980 --> 00:21:05.540
Please don't die.

00:21:07.600 --> 00:21:10.880
What's a true duelist?

00:21:13.600 --> 00:21:15.510
Jonouchi?

00:21:21.450 --> 00:21:23.420
You're early, Jonouchi.

00:21:24.270 --> 00:21:27.100
It was morning when I finished my deck.

00:21:27.440 --> 00:21:28.660
Same here.

00:21:34.920 --> 00:21:36.450
Let's do this, Yugi!

00:21:36.450 --> 00:21:38.900
Our Battle City isn't over yet!

00:21:38.900 --> 00:21:39.900
Right!

00:21:43.860 --> 00:21:45.250
Duel!

00:21:56.470 --> 00:22:01.140
After Battle City ended, everyone traveled their own path.

00:22:01.140 --> 00:22:05.970
After gathering the three God Cards to unlock his memories...

00:22:05.970 --> 00:22:09.520
...the other Yugi will soon begin his journey.

00:22:09.520 --> 00:22:14.870
I feel nostalgic about all the moments I spent with Yugi in Domino City.

00:22:14.870 --> 00:22:19.000
Will we go our separate ways?  Or...

00:22:19.000 --> 00:22:20.910
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh:
Signs

00:22:20.910 --> 00:22:22.770
Duel, standby!

00:22:29.700 --> 00:22:38.610
The streets flow by, colored in red

00:22:39.110 --> 00:22:46.950
If you notice your pain, it changes to joy

00:22:48.680 --> 00:22:58.110
People learn of friendship every time they wipe their tears

00:22:58.730 --> 00:23:07.630
With the warm strength you gave me, I'll change them into kindness

00:23:08.200 --> 00:23:16.660
My overflowing emotions don't stop

00:23:17.440 --> 00:23:22.170
I'll live feeling them

00:23:22.780 --> 00:23:27.350
For me to be me

00:23:27.350 --> 00:23:35.810
Overflowing friendship heals me

00:23:36.490 --> 00:23:41.450
Our chance meeting was real

00:23:41.970 --> 00:23:51.110
We'll both understand that someday
